{
 "_README": "Fleet dashboard design tokens (kit v5; states block kit v9). Source of truth; tokens.css is generated from this file by MAIN and must not be edited. Link tokens.css and use var(--fk-<name>); map a state word to a colour with status_map.",
 "schema": 1,
